// The open ocean and the deep (V2-10 (f)): off the shelves, where the water is poorer, the
// great whales, the oceanic sharks, the tunas and the flying fish of the sunlit water, and below
// them the lanternfish rising each night from the dark and the anglerfish with its glowing lure.
// Densities are per km² of sea.
